{
  "_note": "本盒余量(11,68×60,card-design-system §8.2):名 / 还剩几片 + 已用细轨 / 几天后停药(或开新盒);停药期写「停药 · 第 N 天」。2026-10-08 新增,零新增请求:复用 flow/w.df 的 pillsLeft / pkind / nDays / todayIdx / active(与首页「还剩 8 片」同一个量)。默认脱敏同 today:名字是用户自设别名。",
  "rc": {
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "defaultAlias": "每日记录",
        "unit": "片",
        "nbsp": " ",
        "toBreak": " 天后停药",
        "toNew": " 天后新盒",
        "rest": "停药",
        "dayPre": "第 ",
        "dayPost": " 天",
        "setup": "点开设置",
        "notStarted": "未开始"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "defaultAlias": "Doses",
        "unit": "left",
        "nbsp": " ",
        "toBreak": "d to break",
        "toNew": "d to new",
        "rest": "Break",
        "dayPre": "Day ",
        "dayPost": "",
        "setup": "Tap to set",
        "notStarted": "Not started"
      }
    },
    "i18nEmptyOk": [
      "dayPost"
    ],
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#F9FCFB\\,#EDF7F4)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#161A1D\\,#192021)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "8pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#128F66|#6FE8BE",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "17pt",
        "y": "7pt",
        "w": "43pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${alias},${@i18n.defaultAlias})]",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "_note": "服药期:主值 = 本盒还剩几片(w.df 的 pillsLeft,≤ 2 位数,字号恒 20pt)+ 一条已用 / 活性片数的细轨。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${pkind},0),1),1,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${pkind},0),2),1,0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "num",
            "type": "richText",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "21pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "spans": [
              {
                "text": "${pillsLeft}",
                "fontSize": "20pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
              },
              {
                "text": "${@i18n.nbsp}",
                "fontSize": "10pt",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              },
              {
                "text": "${@i18n.unit}",
                "fontSize": "10pt",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "op",
            "action": "set",
            "props": {
              "key": "_den",
              "value": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${active},0),1),${active},1)]"
            }
          },
          {
            "_note": "已用比例的终点(轨盒 54×3、圆头 → 可用 [1.5,52.5]);外层 round 防 Android calc 出 double。",
            "type": "op",
            "action": "set",
            "props": {
              "key": "_px",
              "value": "$[round::(calc::(1.5+51*(${_den}-${pillsLeft})/${_den}),1)]"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "trk",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[1.5,1.5,52.5,1.5]",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "40pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "3pt",
            "lineWidth": "3pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#E7E9EE|#2A2D33"
          },
          {
            "id": "fil",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[1.5,1.5,$[findNotEmpty::(${_px},1.5)],1.5]",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "40pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "3pt",
            "lineWidth": "3pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#128F66|#6FE8BE"
          },
          {
            "id": "foot",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "47pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(${pkind},1),${nDays}${@i18n.toBreak},${nDays}${@i18n.toNew})]",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "停药期:主值写「停药」,底行「第 N 天」(停药期内的第几天)。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${pkind},0),3),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "rst",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "22pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "${@i18n.rest}",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          },
          {
            "id": "rstN",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "46pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "${@i18n.dayPre}$[round::(calc::(${todayIdx}-${active}+1))]${@i18n.dayPost}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "没设计划 / 计划未开始 / 取不到:值位「--」,底行一句状态。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${pkind},0),0),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "numE",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "28pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          },
          {
            "id": "footE",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "46pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${hasPlan},-1),0),${@i18n.setup},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${future},0),1),${@i18n.notStarted},--))]",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
